sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant ServiceCatalog
    participant CatalogDB
    participant Kafka

    User           ->>  ServiceCatalog      :   HTTP PUT http://service-catalog/api/v1/books/{bookId} <br/>UpdateBookRequest
    ServiceCatalog ->>  CatalogDB           :   findBookById
    alt Not Found
        CatalogDB      -->> ServiceCatalog  :   Null
        ServiceCatalog -->> User            :   HTTP 404 Not Found
    else BookEntity
        CatalogDB      -->> ServiceCatalog  :   BookEntity
        ServiceCatalog ->>  ServiceCatalog  :   validate requested status transition<br/>(state machine — see open question)
        alt Invalid status transition
            ServiceCatalog -->> User        :   HTTP 409 Conflict
        else Valid update
            ServiceCatalog ->>  CatalogDB   :   UPDATE book
            CatalogDB      -->> ServiceCatalog : ok
            alt Status field changed
                ServiceCatalog ->>  Kafka   :   publish BookStatusChangedEvent <br/>(bookId, oldStatus, newStatus)
                Kafka          -->> ServiceCatalog : ack
            else Status unchanged (e.g. only title/author edited)
                ServiceCatalog ->>  ServiceCatalog : no event published
            end
            ServiceCatalog -->> User        :   HTTP 200 OK UpdateBookResponse
        end
    end
